/f31c3de5-4392-4af2-bb01-ecf594df6e60.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/b363de91-1d4f-4589-be70-4ebfc3f29bdc.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":["bedroom"],"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/b363de91-1d4f-4589-be70-4ebfc3f29bdc.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/b363de91-1d4f-4589-be70-4ebfc3f29bdc.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/b363de91-1d4f-4589-be70-4ebfc3f29bdc.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/b363de91-1d4f-4589-be70-4ebfc3f29bdc.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/b363de91-1d4f-4589-be70-4ebfc3f29bdc.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/8cf08189-1f80-49b8-94f4-f8d75b94cf78.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":["bedroom"],"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/8cf08189-1f80-49b8-94f4-f8d75b94cf78.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/8cf08189-1f80-49b8-94f4-f8d75b94cf78.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/8cf08189-1f80-49b8-94f4-f8d75b94cf78.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/8cf08189-1f80-49b8-94f4-f8d75b94cf78.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1716979/8cf08189-1f80-49b8-94f4-f8d75b94cf78.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Are you a remote worker, a couple, or an academic who needs more than just a single cramped room? If you are looking for an upscale, spacious living setup where you can separate your work life from your rest life—without the massive hassle of buying furniture or setting up utility contracts—this is the perfect solution.\n\nI am offering both available bedrooms in my beautiful 3rd-floor apartment as a combined, private dual-room package. It is the ultimate turn-key setup for someone who values space, premium comfort, and a peaceful sanctuary next to nature.\n\nYour Private 2-Room Suite Includes:\nBoth rooms are completely furnished, styled, and filled with ample natural daylight:\n\nRoom 1 [The Master Bedroom - 15 m2]: A large, south-facing room looking into a quiet, green backyard compound filled with trees and birds chirping. It features a luxurious King-Size bed, premium bedside tables, a spacious wardrobe, a desk, and a chair. Open the wide windows and let nature right in.\n\nRoom 2 [The Home Office / Guest Room - 10 m2]: A cozy room facing north with an uninterrupted, magical view of the open sky and a local forest. It comes fully equipped with a Queen-Size bed, a wardrobe, a desk, and a chair. It is the perfect space for a dedicated, quiet home office, creative studio, or a comfortable guest room for when family visits.\n\nThe Luxury of Space (18 m2 Kitchen & Dining Lounge):\nBeyond your two private rooms, you will have access to the largest space in the apartment: our massive, combined 18 m2 kitchen and dining area. It is a total luxury compared to standard flats. I love using this area to warm up food, sit right by the window, and watch the magical evening sunsets over the forest.\n\nPremium Facilities (Everything is Handled):\nYou don’t need to buy a single appliance. The apartment is fully loaded with top-tier convenience features:\n\nBlazing Fast 250 Mbps Internet: Rock-solid and lag-free, perfect for heavy video calls, programming, or research.\n\nWashing Machine with Built-in Dryer: No hanging wet clothes around your rooms for days.\n\nDishwasher: Eliminates daily chores and keeps the kitchen immaculate.\n\nMicrowave with Grill: For quick, seamless meal prep.\n\nAmple personal storage in the kitchen, plus a big fridge with a completely separate freezer.\n\nLocation & Easy Berlin Commute:\nNestled in a quiet, green neighborhood in Eberswalde (16227), commuting is incredibly efficient. Local buses run right nearby every 10 minutes (12–15 mins to Eberswalde Hbf). From the station, two Regional Express (RE) trains get you straight into the heart of Berlin within just 35 minutes! Daily shopping (Netto, Penny, Kaufland) is all within a few minutes' walk or drive.\n\nAbout Me & Our Flatshare Vibe:\nI am a startup founder and researcher in my early 40s. I occupy the third bedroom (with the balcony). I spend most of my time on my laptop building my company, so I treat this home as a quiet, clean, non-smoking, and non-party sanctuary. I deeply respect personal boundaries and mind my own business, but I am always happy to have a friendly, informal chitchat over tea in our dining lounge!\n\nKitchen Preference: I am a strict vegetarian. I do not cook heavy meals and highly prefer a kitchen completely free of heavy, lingering, or strong food odors that can seep into wardrobes. Light cooking and clean habits are a must.\n\nThe Financial Peace of Mind:\nThe premium rate for taking both rooms is a fully all-inclusive fixed rate (Warmmiete). This covers both fully furnished rooms, heating, water, electricity, and the 250 Mbps internet. You get total financial predictability—no surprise utility bills or back-payments at the end of the year. Official city registration (Anmeldung) is absolutely possible.\n\nHow to Apply:\nIf you (or you and your partner) are looking for a premium, spacious lifestyle, please send a message and tell me:\n\nWhat do you do for work or study here in Eberswalde?\nWhat is your preferred move-in date and how long do you plan to stay?\nWhat does your typical daily routine look like?\nBased on the description, what is my specific food habit or kitchen preference?\n\n(Please note: To filter out automatic spam, I will skip messages that don't answer these questions)","facilities":{"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"15"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"housematesGender":{"value":"shared_w_boys"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"shared"},"kitchenware":{"value":"shared"},"livingRoom":{"value":"shared"},"parking":{"value":"shared"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"shared"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":96800,"deposit":150000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"968.00","deposit":"1500.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":3,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":3,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-07-13"}],"updated":"2026-07-13T12:40:44Z","__utId__":"ut1716979"}]